  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UKRI COVID-19 Grant Extension Allocation (CoA) provided organisations with resources to sustain UKRI grant-funded research during the period of pandemic disruption and its immediate aftermath. Some of the funding was directly used supporting the following ODA-eligible grants at University of Aberdeen: NE/S011641/1; 
MR/P014844/1; 
ES/T003073/1; 
NE/S006923/1.</narrative>
